In both datasets, we restricted the dataset to the numerical data features and only considered patients without missing information. We apply the geometrization process as described in \autoref{tab:Geometrized_table}. For the METABRIC dataset, we additionally included a feature representing the duration of time the patient lived with the tumor, calculated as the difference between the date of death and the treatment start date. Due to computational limitations, we restricted the computation of the local FRC to edges ($1$-FRC).
