The rest of the paper is structured as follows. Section~\ref{sec:sc-sap} describes a more abstract subspace-constrained sketch-and-project framework for solving general linear systems.
In Section~\ref{sec:sc-rcd}, the analysis is specialized to the SC-RCD method.
