\subsection{Ablation Study}
\label{exp:ab}
 To fully validate the effectiveness of our design, we conduct ablation studies on the key designs of LIRA.

\textbf{Effectiveness of SEFE.} To validate the effectiveness of SEFE, we conducted ablation experiments using the InternLM2-1.8B ~\cite{internlm2} and InternLM2.5-7B~\cite{internlm2} backbones. As shown in Tab.~\ref{tab:sefe_effect}, incorporating SEFE led to an average improvement of 5.7\% on understanding tasks and 3.8\% on segmentation tasks when using the InternLM2-1.8B backbone. Similarly, with the InternLM2.5-7B backbone, we observed an average improvement of 5.1\% on understanding tasks and 3.4\% on segmentation tasks.
This improvement can likely be attributed to SEFE's ability to enhance the model's visual comprehension capabilities, enabling it to interpret visual instructions more effectively and thereby improve segmentation accuracy. 

