As shown in Tab.~\ref{tab:main}, we enhance segmentation capabilities while also slightly improving comprehension accuracy (75.2\% vs. 74.8\%) compared to IntenVL2 through LIRA. 
Notably, in terms of hallucination reduction, our model shows clear performance improvements across the Chair, POPE, and TinyLVLM datasets, achieving consistent gains with both the 2B and 8B models.







