    that have operator-sum representations consisting of matrices of algebraic numbers,\footnote{It is well known \cite{NC00} that using only the members of a fixed, small set of algebraic numbers as the transition amplitudes (i.e., the entries of these matrices)  is sufficient for universal quantum computation.} is the first-stage transition function, %\{\mathcal{E}_q \mid q \in Q\setminus \Set{q_{acc},q_{rej}}\}$ is the ,!!!!!!!!!!!BUNU 2QCFA GİBİ İNPUTA DA BAĞIMLI HALE GETİRİP FOOTNOTE'DA w03 BUNU İKİ KAT ADIMDA SİMÜLE EDER DE!!!!!!!!!!!!
