If $d_P=1$, the second-stage transition concludes by swapping the qubit at the newly arrived position of the proof tape head by the first qubit of the finite quantum register.
We assume that $\delta_2$ is restricted so that it  never attempts to move the input head  off the tape area containing $\lend w\rend$, or to move any  work head to the left of the leftmost cell of the corresponding tape.
