%, \tfrac{m}{\lfloor\log m\rfloor+1}\in\mathbb{N}
\}.     
\end{equation*}
 Note that $L_u\subsetneq L_S$ (Section \ref{sec:defs}), such that $L_u$ contains only the strings whose rightmost segments represent some integer of the form $2^m-1$, where $m$ is a positive integer. 
