As its counterpart $M_{RPAL_i}$ in the proof of Theorem \ref{thm:mrpal}, $M_{PPPAL_i}$ starts with a deterministic format check in stage (R). This control, which can  be implemented in a single non-stop left-to-right scan of the tape, is passed without rejection if
