    \item the input is of the form $x$cbin$_i(i)y$, where cbin$_i(i)$ is in the leftmost block, neither the prefix $x$ nor the postfix $y$ contain cbin$_i(i)$, $x$ consists  of one or more segments of the form $\Sigma_{\mathtt{ab}}^+$ separated by delimiters of the form cbin$_i(j)$ where $1\leq j<i$, and all segments in $y$ are of the form $\mathtt{a}^+$, and are separated by separators of the form $0^{c_i}$ or   $\$$. 
