\end{center}
\label{fig:wong1997sampling}
\end{figure}
%
\paragraph*{Separation without equidistribution.}

Hamkins \cite{Ham96} and Hamkins and Zeger \cite{HamZ97a} constructed $\Sphere^{\Dim}$ codes with asymptotically optimal packing density
(Figure \ref{fig:HamZ97a}).
%
