\section{Methodology}
\label{sec:methodology}

Building on recent advances in reinforcement learning–driven reasoning for large language models (LLMs)~\cite{zhong2017seq2sql, guo2025deepseek_r1, chen2025graph_reward_sql}, CogniSQL-R1-Zero trains a 7B-parameter model to generate executable SQL by optimizing directly for execution correctness and format-tag compliance. 

