\section{Results}
\label{sec:results}

We evaluate \textbf{CogniSQL-R1-Zero} on the BIRD-dev dataset, using \textit{execution accuracy} (Ex\%) as our primary metric. We assess performance in two distinct settings: (1) \emph{single-sample generation}—the model outputs one SQL per question; and (2) \emph{test-time scaling} via best-of-N sampling, where six SQLs are generated and the highest-executing one is selected. This follows the test-time scaling framework proposed by ~\cite{huang2023scaling}.

