In this setup, the model produces a single SQL query per natural language prompt. Figure~\ref{fig:exec_acc_single} traces execution accuracy over the RL training trajectory. The base Qwen2.5-7B-Coder model begins at 52.02\% after learning it climbs steadily through reward optimization, to 59.97\% in step 34K.


