\section{DISTINCT}

Based on the above findings, we propose a novel LLM-based unit test generation framework, which is designed to efficiently generate test cases capable of accurately detecting defects in the focal method. DISTINCT consists of three main stages: (1) Generator: generating candidate test cases from the focal method and its NLD, (2) Validator: validating and repairing these test cases through iterative compilation and logic consistency checks, and (3) Analyzer: iteratively refining test semantics by aligning their logic with the behavior described in the NLD. The workflow of DISTINCT is illustrated in Figure~\ref{fig:workflow}. 

