\subsection{Transcript Generation (ASR)}
To generate video transcripts, we utilize Whisper-large model \cite{pmlr-v202-radford23a}, which outperforms YouTube Automatic Captions \cite{Rai2024NPTEL}. Transcripts are generated for both the full-length videos and individual recommendation segments, where each segment corresponds to the portion of the video between the specified start and end timestamps.

