\subsubsection{Comparison on performance}
In this part, we compare YHZ's method to the proposed method (i.e., QXY's method) in terms of computational efficiency.
For this purpose, we carry out several experiments for $n$ ranging from $3$ to $9$. The experiments are performed on a PC equipped with an Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-7300U processor and an 8GB RAM. 

