To quantitatively evaluate the performance of the controllers in the reference tracking scenario, three performance indices, including Root Mean Square Error ($RMSE$), Integral Square Error ($ISE$) and control energy, were computed over $n_{\text{sim}}$ simulation steps, as defined below:
